# Figma snapshot (no MCP in CI / Cloud Agents)

**CI and Cloud Agents cannot** rely on the Figma MCP. **Local Cursor agents may** when Figma MCP is connected; use it to read or refresh the file, then commit an updated snapshot when tokens change. The repo copy of design variables is **`docs/figma/variables.json`** — that plus `docs/design-system.md` and `tokens.css` is the merge contract.

Before changing tokens or design-system values:

1. Read `docs/design-system.md` → [How the Figma source of truth reaches the repo](docs/design-system.md#how-the-figma-source-of-truth-reaches-the-repo).
2. Match non-null snapshot values in `tokens.css` and document them in `design-system.md`.
3. Do **not** invent Figma values; null snapshot fields are pending export only.
4. PRs that change design values without updating the snapshot must **flag it in the PR body**.
